From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 05:59:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: allwinner: a733: Add the PRCM I2C controllers

The PMIC and the USB Type-C port controller of A733 boards sit on the
I2C controllers in the PRCM domain, S_TWI0 and S_TWI1. The device tree
has no node for them.

Add both: S_TWI0 at 0x07083000 and S_TWI1 at 0x07084000, with the PRCM bus
clocks and resets, and the pin groups boards use: PL0/PL1 function 2 for
S_TWI0 and PL12/PL13 function 3 for S_TWI1. The compatible falls back to
the V536 and A31 controllers, as the A733 binding asks. Both nodes stay
disabled; boards enable them.

Not covered: S_TWI2, the TWI controllers of the CPUX domain and "dmas",
which the driver does not use.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on two boards with the buses enabled
by the next patch; both controllers probe and register an I2C adapter.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi | 40 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 40 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
index 1a46a3afefe9..31d98b95d319 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
@@ -536,6 +536,46 @@ r_pio: pinctrl@7025000 {
 			#gpio-cells = <3>;
 			interrupt-controller;
 			#interrupt-cells = <3>;
+
+			/omit-if-no-ref/
+			r_i2c0_pl_pins: r-i2c0-pl-pins {
+				pins = "PL0", "PL1";
+				allwinner,pinmux = <2>;
+				function = "r_i2c0";
+			};
+
+			/omit-if-no-ref/
+			r_i2c1_pl12_pins: r-i2c1-pl12-pins {
+				pins = "PL12", "PL13";
+				allwinner,pinmux = <3>;
+				function = "r_i2c1";
+			};
+		};
+
+		r_i2c0: i2c@7083000 {
+			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-i2c",
+				     "allwinner,sun8i-v536-i2c",
+				     "allwinner,sun6i-a31-i2c";
+			reg = <0x07083000 0x400>;
+			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 203 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+			clocks = <&r_ccu CLK_BUS_R_I2C0>;
+			resets = <&r_ccu RST_BUS_R_I2C0>;
+			status = "disabled";
+			#address-cells = <1>;
+			#size-cells = <0>;
+		};
+
+		r_i2c1: i2c@7084000 {
+			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-i2c",
+				     "allwinner,sun8i-v536-i2c",
+				     "allwinner,sun6i-a31-i2c";
+			reg = <0x07084000 0x400>;
+			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 204 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+			clocks = <&r_ccu CLK_BUS_R_I2C1>;
+			resets = <&r_ccu RST_BUS_R_I2C1>;
+			status = "disabled";
+			#address-cells = <1>;
+			#size-cells = <0>;
 		};
 
 		rtc: rtc@7090000 {
